### ============================================================================
### Menu Move Up/Down API Tests
### Base URL: http://129.204.59.156:30081
### API Prefix: /api/adm/menu/app
### ============================================================================
@baseUrl = http://129.204.59.156:30081
@apiPrefix = /api/adm/menu/app
@menuId = 176

### ============================================================================
### Setup: Get menu group and current orderNum
### ============================================================================

###
### Get menu group (tree structure)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group

###
### Get all menus (including invisible)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus

###
### Get specific menu details to check current orderNum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

### ============================================================================
### Test 1: Move Up (orderNum + 1)
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-01-01: Move menu up (orderNum + 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup

###
### TC-01-02: Verify orderNum increased
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-01-03: Move up again (orderNum + 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup

###
### TC-01-04: Verify orderNum increased again
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

### ============================================================================
### Test 2: Move Down (orderNum - 1, minimum 0)
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-02-01: Move menu down (orderNum - 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-02-02: Verify orderNum decreased
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-02-03: Move down multiple times
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-02-04: Move down again
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-02-05: Verify orderNum is at minimum (0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-02-06: Try to move down when already at 0 (should stay at 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-02-07: Verify orderNum is still 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

### ============================================================================
### Test 3: Verify Sorting in Menu Group
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-03-01: Set a high orderNum to a menu
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup
# Repeat this 10 times to get orderNum=10

###
### TC-03-02: Get menu group and check if orderNum affects display
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/group

###
### TC-03-03: Get all menus sorted by orderNum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus?pageNum=1&pageSize=10&orderBy=order_num&sort=ASC

### ============================================================================
### Test 4: Edge Cases
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-04-01: Try move up on non-existent menu ID (should return error)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/999999/op/moveup

###
### TC-04-02: Try move down on non-existent menu ID (should return error)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/999999/op/movedown

### ============================================================================
### Test 5: Rapid Successive Operations
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-05-01: Move up 3 times in quick succession
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup

###
### TC-05-02: Move up again
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup

###
### TC-05-03: Move up again
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup

###
### TC-05-04: Verify final orderNum
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-05-05: Move down 5 times in quick succession
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-05-06: Move down again
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-05-07: Move down again
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-05-08: Move down again
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-05-09: Move down again
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-05-10: Verify final orderNum (should be 0 or close to 0)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

### ============================================================================
### Cleanup: Reset orderNum to 0
### ============================================================================

###
### Reset by moving down multiple times until 0
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### Verify reset to 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

### ============================================================================
### Test 6: Null orderNum Handling
### ============================================================================

###
### TC-06-01: Set orderNum to null via direct SQL (simulate null scenario)
### Note: This requires direct database access or a special endpoint

###
### TC-06-02: Move up when orderNum is null (should set to 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup

###
### TC-06-03: Verify orderNum is now 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-06-04: Move down when orderNum is 1 (should set to 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-06-05: Verify orderNum is now 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-06-06: Move down when orderNum is 0 (should stay at 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/movedown

###
### TC-06-07: Verify orderNum is still 0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

###
### TC-06-08: Move up when orderNum is 0 (should set to 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/menus/{{menuId}}/op/moveup

###
### TC-06-09: Verify orderNum is now 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/adm/menu/menus/{{menuId}}

### ============================================================================
### Summary Table: orderNum Behavior
### ============================================================================

# | Current Value | Operation | Result |
# |---------------|-----------|--------|
# | null          | moveup    | 1      |
# | null          | movedown  | 0      |
# | 0             | moveup    | 1      |
# | 0             | movedown  | 0      |
# | 5             | moveup    | 6      |
# | 5             | movedown  | 4      |
# | 1             | movedown  | 0      |
